  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 760378,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 2 Games in 1: Sonic Pinball Party + Columns Crown - Game Boy Advance\n\nRelive the classic arcade experience with *2 Games in 1: Sonic Pinball Party + Columns Crown* for the Game Boy Advance! This unique compilation delivers two beloved titles on a single cartridge, offering hours of addictive gameplay.\n\nFirst, dive into the fast-paced world of *Sonic Pinball Party*, where you’ll flip, spin, and boost your way through vibrant pinball tables themed around the iconic Sonic the Hedgehog universe. Collect rings, defeat enemies, and unlock exciting bonus stages.\n\nThen, challenge yourself with *Columns Crown*, a captivating puzzle game where you strategically arrange falling blocks to create lines and clear the screen. Master the art of chain reactions and compete for the highest score in this timeless classic.\n\nWith a simple menu to choose your preferred game, *2 Games in 1* provides a fantastic value and a nostalgic trip for fans of both Sega franchises. Get ready for double the fun on your Game Boy Advance!"
    },
